WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
On one side is the future master

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,600
On one side is a loser who cannot practice cultivation.

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,680
There is no need to think about this choice at all

4
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:08,170
OK I understand

5
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:10,330
It just so happens that Huangsha Town is also short of people.

6
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:12,170
I feel like he would fit in there quite well.

7
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,240
It seems that Mr. Zhang feels the same way as me.

8
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,320
Mr. Zhang is good at listening to other people's opinions.

9
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:25,990
The person I will communicate with General Shen is called Li Dao

10
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:28,230
Who told you to call me this name?

11
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,960
I can only count you as unlucky

12
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,520
Although it is already ready

13
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,240
But the paper tree turns over

14
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:45,020
Or do you have a better sense of who you are, Li Daojia?

15
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:47,420
What do you want to do with our young master?

16
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:48,460
Li Daocheng enlists in the army

17
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:49,980
I'm here to deliver a report letter

18
00:00:53,990 --> 00:00:55,550
Master, your report letter

19
00:01:02,550 --> 00:01:03,990
Daying, Huangsha Town

20
00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:06,260
I've never heard of this name.

21
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:08,290
But let's make peace with it
